<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>企業品牌服務｜專業網頁設計</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@300;500;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #1a2a6c; /* 科技深藍 */
            --accent: #f39c12;  /* 活力橘 */
            --bg-light: #f8f9fa;
            --white: #ffffff;
        }
        body { margin: 0; font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
        
        /* 主視覺區 */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a2a6c, #b21f1f, #fdbb2d);
            height: 60vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 10px; text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        .hero p { font-size: 1.2rem; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .cta-btn {
            background: var(--accent);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(243, 156, 18, 0.4);
        }
        .cta-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.05); background: #e67e22; }

        /* 三欄特色區 */
        .features { padding: 80px 20px; background: var(--bg-light); text-align: center; }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .feature-card { background: white; padding: 40px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .icon { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 15px; display: block; }

        /* 定價表 */
        .pricing { padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center; }
        .price-grid { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; margin-top: 40px; }
        .price-card { border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 40px; width: 280px; border-radius: 15px; transition: 0.3s; }
        .price-card.hot { border: 2px solid var(--accent); transform: scale(1.05); position: relative; }
        .price-card.hot::after { content: "最受歡迎"; position: absolute; top: -15px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background: var(--accent); color: white; padding: 5px 15px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.8rem; }
        .price-card h4 { margin: 0; color: #777; }
        .price-amount { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin: 20px 0; color: var(--primary); }

        /* 客戶推薦 */
        .testimonial { background: var(--primary); color: white; padding: 60px 20px; text-align: center; }
        .quote { font-size: 1.5rem; font-style: italic; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
        
        footer { padding: 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #888; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header class="hero">
        <div>
            <h1>創新設計・驅動未來</h1>
            <p>我們提供最專業的數位轉型方案，讓您的品牌脫穎而出</p>
            <a href="#pricing" class="cta-btn">探索方案</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="features">
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <span class="icon">🎨</span>
                <h3>卓越美學</h3>
                <p>由設計系專業團隊操刀，打造極致視覺。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <span class="icon">⚡</span>
                <h3>極速載入</h3>
                <p>優化每一行程式碼，效率是我們的堅持。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <span class="icon">🔒</span>
                <h3>資安保障</h3>
                <p>最先進的加密技術，守護您的企業數據。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pricing" class="pricing">
        <h2>定價方案</h2>
        <div class="price-grid">
            <div class="price-card">
                <h4>入門版</h4>
                <div class="price-amount">$99</div>
                <p>適合個人工作室</p>
            </div>
            <div class="price-card hot">
                <h4>進階版</h4>
                <div class="price-amount">$299</div>
                <p>中小企業首選</p>
            </div>
            <div class="price-card">
                <h4>專業版</h4>
                <div class="price-amount">$999</div>
                <p>大型集團定制</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonial">
        <p class="quote">「這是我合作過最有美感的開發團隊，細節處理得非常到位！」</p>
        <p style="margin-top:20px;">— 創意總監 陳小姐</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 數位品牌實驗室｜專業網頁設計作業</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
